  "hero_headline": "AI 演进突飞猛进，全球局势与经济避险情绪交织 / AI Evolution Accelerates Amid Global Geopolitical and Economic Tensions",
  "daily_overview": "在科技领域，AI 开发效率与代理能力显著跃升，从实时世界模型到代码代理的落地，预示着自动化生产力的又一次变革。财经方面，受伊朗局势及地缘动荡影响，油价高位波动引发通胀隐忧，各国政府正试图平衡财政压力与资本管制。与此同时，法国动荡局势与美国对华技术限制等时政议题，持续考验着跨国治理的韧性。总体而言，全球正在经历从传统工业向智能化、高风险向避险性的结构性过渡。\n\nIn technology, the leap in AI agent capabilities—ranging from real-time world models to automated coding agents—signals a new paradigm in productivity. Economically, geopolitical volatility, particularly in Iran, is sustaining oil prices and fueling inflation concerns, forcing governments to navigate fiscal pressures and capital controls. Meanwhile, geopolitical friction, including civil unrest in France and expanded US restrictions on Chinese AI models, continues to challenge global governance. Overall, the world is undergoing a structural shift toward intelligent automation and risk-averse financial positioning.",
